["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/homePage", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "A place for the SPDX document creator to record a website that serves as the\npackage's home page.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
